Description:
Creating with @scefinternational was a joy, and seeing it all come together at their recent stakeholder symposium was the cherry on top. 
@cocoaasekrakye took the stage for @interactivedigi, walking everyone through the heart and thinking behind the rebrand. More than just a facelift, it was a full-circle moment of purpose, pride, and powerful storytelling.

#BrandID #SCEFRebrand #SCEFAt15 #FreeTheChildren
